# Line endings are a repository property, not a per-contributor setting.
#
# Every tracked text file is stored with LF in the repository and checked out
# with LF in the working tree, regardless of core.autocrlf. This matches the
# LF output the engine scripts write (Write-Utf8LfFile in _system/scripts) and
# keeps generated files byte-identical to what regen produces, so a checkout
# never reports spurious modifications. Binary files are detected and left
# untouched by text=auto.
* text=auto eol=lf
